  "actualMaterialSource": "Same main-checkout read-only mounts on both runs, at a6a1ea59122b2c2cb6c82540ba20fcc996af1208. All tree identities agree other than contracts; the 34 contract-path changes are additions of previous independent review evidence under contracts/stage-plan-review-evidence/2026-11-25/learning-plan-regrouping/.",
  "finding": "With both unit openings open, the revised ordinary handoff starts the child opening and records the child cursor where fresh normal reconciliation persists the parent opening and cursor. Both use the same final target and focus. Baseline handoff remained inactive and kept the previous focus; baseline reconciliation already advertised the child but persisted the parent. No target content started in these probes. With only the parent unpassed both arms of both revisions remained inactive; the target cases with parent already passed agreed on the child opening."
